urname>Counor</surname><given-names>D.</given-names></name><name><surname>Filipe</surname><given-names>C.</given-names></name><etal/><article-title>A virulence factor of myxoma virus colocalizes with NF-kappaB in the nucleus and interferes with inflammation</article-title><source>J. Virol.</source><year>2004</year><volume>78</volume><fpage>2510</fpage><lpage>2516</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14963153</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="R7"><label>7</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Chakrabarti</surname><given-names>S.</given-names></name><name><surname>Brechling</surname><given-names>K.</given-names></name><name><surname>Moss</surname><given-names>B.</given-names></name><article-title>Vaccinia virus expression vector: coexpression of beta-galactosidase provides visual screening of recombinant virus plaques</article-title><source>Mol. Cell. Biol.</source><year>1985</year><volume>5</volume><fpage>3403</fpage><lpage>3409</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3939316</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="R8"><label>8</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Dundr</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Leno</surname><given-names>G.H.</given-names></name><name><surname>Hammarskjold</surname><given-names>M.L.</given-names></name><name><surname>Rekosh</surname><given-names>D.</given-names></name><name><surname>Helga-Maria</surname><given-names>C.</given-names></name><name><surname>Olson</surname><given-names>M.O.</given-names></name><article-title>The roles of nucleolar structure and function in the subcellular location of the HIV-1 Rev protein</article-title><source>J. Cell Sci.</source><year>1995</year><volume>108</volume><fpage>2811</fpage><lpage>2823</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7593322</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="R9"><label>9</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Falkner</surname><given-names>F.G.</given-names></name><name><surname>